<title>USA: Wet Seal to open 30 new stores in 1998.</title>
<headline>Wet Seal to open 30 new stores in 1998.</headline>
<text>
<p>IRVINE, Calif., Aug 7 - Wet Seal Inc Thursday said it opened 6 stores in the second quarter and expects to open a total of approximately 30 stores in the current year and 75 stores next year.</p>
